ocsf:OcsfCompliance a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The Compliance object contains information about Industry and Regulatory Framework standards, controls and requirements or details about custom assessments utilized in a compliance evaluation. Standards define broad security frameworks, controls represent specific security requirements within those frameworks, and checks are the testable verification points used to determine if controls are properly implemented." ;
