	rdfs:comment "The DNS Section object represents a DNS message section that carries supplementary resource records alongside an optional TSIG record. It is used for both the client Additional section (<code>query_additional</code>) and the server Additional section (<code>response_additional</code>) of a DNS message. A DNS message has at most one TSIG record, which authenticates the entire message." ;
	rdfs:label "DNS Section" ;
