_:c14n1882 sh:description "The normalized status of the event outcome. Use this family of attributes to convey the outcome of the activity described by the event. Producers should map their source outcome to <code>1</code> (Success) or <code>2</code> (Failure). Use <code>0</code> (Unknown) when the outcome cannot be determined, and <code>99</code> (Other) with a populated <code>status</code> string when the source value does not map cleanly." ;
