	sh:description "The total time, in milliseconds, that the trace covers, calculated as the difference between start_time and end_time. This duration helps assess the overall performance of a request as it travels across various services, and is essential for identifying latency and potential bottlenecks within the distributed system. The trace duration may differ from individual span durations due to the propagation and processing times of the trace as it spans multiple components." ;
	sh:maxCount 1 ;
	sh:name "Duration Milliseconds" ;
	sh:nodeKind sh:Literal ;
	sh:order 0 ;
