_:c14n5754 sh:description "The event/finding type ID. It identifies the event's semantics and structure. Producers and mappers <b>must</b> compute this as <code>class_uid * 100 + activity_id</code>. It uniquely identifies the combination of event class and activity across the entire schema. For example, <code>Detection Finding: Create</code> is <code>200401</code>." ;
	sh:maxCount 1 ;
	sh:minCount 1 ;
