	sh:description "The source-specific status or error code as reported by the event source. For example, a Windows logon failure code (<code>0x18</code>), an HTTP response code (<code>403</code>), or an AWS API error code. This preserves the original code for detailed troubleshooting beyond what <code>status_id</code> conveys." ;
